{
  "name": "Infinite Dungeons",
  "short_name": "Infinite Dungeons",
  "description": "Head down a bottomless dungeon with your friends, through the Smoldering Crypt, the lava of The Sunken Forge and the giant mushrooms of Toadstool Hollow: smash skeletons, forge brutes and frogs, grab rarer and rarer weapons up to Mythic and Legendary, bring down the Ossuary Warden, The Forgemaster and The Toad King, then leave with your loot or go deeper.",
